//     s, timings and hit boxes kept (his hit regions hang off his foot point and the drawn box, which neither dy nor the re-bakes move).
//   TEST PINS - gravitos_feet_plant_test pins 3 + 4 (far foot 1-5 px / near foot <= 18 px into the floor) move with forms 1-2's push.
// GUARDED: each replaced frame must hold EITHER origin's bytes OR the re-baked ones; each table value EITHER the old OR the new value; each
